,"textMapHash":3956841554,"text":"やあやあ！調子はどうだ！「荒瀧煌々虫相撲大修行」の進捗を私にも見せてくれ…","nextNodeIds":[716664002]},{"nodeId":716664002,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":485180810,"text":"ちょうどいいところに来たな、煙緋！","nextNodeIds":[716664003]},{"nodeId":716664003,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"荒瀧一斗","textMapHash":1959218130,"text":"大恩人！今回の大会開催を手伝ってくれてあんがとな！あと、あの超かっこいい告知絵も！","nextNodeIds":[716664004]},{"nodeId":716664004,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"荒瀧一斗","textMapHash":2830770066,"text":"でもよ、その様子を見るに…大恩人も、参加するつもりか？","nextNodeIds":[716664005]},{"nodeId":716664005,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30467,"speakerName":"「装備ガチ勢」","textMapHash":1202139162,"text":"うん？だめなのか？","nextNodeIds":[716664006]},{"nodeId":716664006,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30467,"speakerName":"「装備ガチ勢」","textMapHash":3544626058,"text":"よく海外貿易をやっている大口の顧客がいて、一度彼女の重大案件の裁判を勝訴に導いたことがあってな。それでたくさんの贈り物をもらって、中に特別なオニカブトムシがいたんだ。","nextNodeIds":[716664007]},{"nodeId":716664007,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30467,"speakerName":"「装備ガチ勢」","textMapHash":675004730,"text":"当時は飼い方が分からなかったから、ばあやに面倒を見てもらってたんだが…今見るとこのオニカブトムシ、結構屈強なことに気づいた…","nextNodeIds":[716664008]},{"nodeId":716664008,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30467,"speakerName":"「装備ガチ勢」","textMapHash":789679690,"text":"虫相撲に参加しても、興ざめってことにはならないだろ？","nextNodeIds":[716664009]},{"nodeId":716664009,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30468,"speakerName":"「花角玉将」","textMapHash":819034402,"text":"恩人姉さんを侮るな、鬼王。虫相撲の経験は無いが、驚くほど屈強なオニカブトムシが出てくる。","nextNodeIds":[716664010]},{"nodeId":716664010,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"荒瀧一斗","textMapHash":3137893554,"text":"そうなのか！","nextNodeIds":[716664011]},{"nodeId":716664011,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"荒瀧一斗","textMapHash":244131106,"text":"だったら、「鬼王の右腕」が指揮する「赤紅一杵」に出てもらう。ダチ公ならどんな相手でも、冷静に戦える！","nextNodeIds":[716664012,716664013]},{"nodeId":716664012,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2389896946,"text":"その通り！","nextNodeIds":[716664014]},{"nodeId":716664014,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30467,"speakerName":"「装備ガチ勢」","textMapHash":3307024002,"text":"旅人が私と戦うのか？いいだろう！","nextNodeIds":[716664015]},{"nodeId":716664015,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30467,"speakerName":"「装備ガチ勢」","textMapHash":2400944930,"text":"こういう遊びのコツはまだよく分からないが、上手く指揮ができなくても許してくれよ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":716664013,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":491340570,"text":"お褒めの言葉ありがとう！","nextNodeIds":[716664014]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7166640,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"}}},{"subQuestId":7152702,"order":2,"stepDescription":"","stepDescTextMapHash":3562261236,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7152703,2],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_QUEST_STATE_EQUAL","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[7166643],"talks":[{"talkId":7166643,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List"